---
import {getAsiaOverview} from '../../../data/atlas/asia-overview';
import {southeastIndustryKinds,southeastIndustrySites} from '../../../data/atlas/asia/southeast-asia-industry-sites';
const reading=getAsiaOverview('southeast-asia').reading.readings.find(r=>r.id==='industry')!;
---
<section data-industry-region-reading hidden aria-label="東南アジアの産業と地域全体の供給網">
 <h3>主要産業の広がりを読む</h3>
 <p>地図の国の色は2024年の製造業付加価値のGDP比です。地点は資料で確認できる原料産地や加工・製造の着目位置で、円の大きさは生産量を表しません。原料と工場を直接結ぶ輸送路も示しません。</p>
 <nav class="southeast-industry-choices" aria-label="地図上の産業を強調">{southeastIndustryKinds.map(kind=><button type="button" data-southeast-industry-kind={kind.id} aria-pressed={String(kind.id==='all')}>{kind.label}</button>)}</nav>
 <p class="southeast-industry-summary" data-southeast-industry-summary>{southeastIndustryKinds[0].reading}</p>
 <div class="southeast-industry-sites" data-southeast-industry-sites>{southeastIndustrySites.map(site=><button type="button" data-southeast-industry-site={site.id}><span class={`southeast-industry-symbol ${site.kind} ${site.stage}`} aria-hidden="true"></span>{site.label}</button>)}</div>
 <section data-southeast-industry-selected hidden><h4 data-southeast-industry-selected-title></h4><p data-southeast-industry-selected-reading></p><p class="southeast-industry-source">立地の資料（<span data-southeast-industry-selected-year></span>）：<a data-southeast-industry-selected-source></a></p></section>
 <p>地点の説明は出典年当時の立地事例です。木材加工には輸入材も使われ、森の広がりだけから家具製造や国内仕向けを推定できません。国別産業の詳説はインドネシア・ベトナム・タイを選びますが、地域全体の指標と供給網は11か国・地域を対象にします。</p>
 <h3>地域全体の供給網を読む</h3>
 {reading.paragraphs.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}
 <div class="southeast-industry-links"><button type="button" data-industry-reading-topic="trade-exports" data-industry-reading-detail="t-85">電気機器の輸出</button><button type="button" data-industry-reading-topic="trade-imports" data-industry-reading-detail="t-85">電気機器の輸入</button><button type="button" data-industry-reading-topic="trade-exports" data-industry-reading-detail="t-87">車両・部分品の輸出</button></div>
 <p>商品貿易は2023年の名目米ドルです。港や工場を結ぶ実際の輸送経路、国内仕向け、生産重量を表す図ではありません。</p>
 <details><summary>立地の説明と統計の出典を読む</summary>{reading.sources.map(s=><p><a href={s.url}>{s.label}</a></p>)}<p><a href="https://databank.worldbank.org/metadataglossary/world-development-indicators/series/NV.IND.MANF.ZS">世界銀行WDI：製造業付加価値</a> · <a href="https://comtradeplus.un.org/">国連Comtrade：商品貿易</a></p></details>
</section>
<style>
 .southeast-industry-choices,.southeast-industry-sites{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin:8px 0}.southeast-industry-choices button,.southeast-industry-sites button{min-height:35px;padding:5px 8px;border:1px solid #9baea8;background:#fff;color:#264c52;font:600 11px/1.4 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}.southeast-industry-choices button[aria-pressed=true],.southeast-industry-sites button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e4ede8;border-color:#315b61;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px #315b61}.southeast-industry-sites button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.southeast-industry-sites button.muted{opacity:.42}.southeast-industry-summary{font-weight:600}.southeast-industry-symbol{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#355d75}.southeast-industry-symbol.rubber{background:#c25f2e}.southeast-industry-symbol.wood{background:#827252}.southeast-industry-symbol.raw{border-radius:0;transform:rotate(45deg)}[data-southeast-industry-selected]{padding:8px 10px;background:#f2f6ed;border-left:3px solid #477e6b}[data-southeast-industry-selected] h4{margin:0;font-size:13px}.southeast-industry-source{font-size:11px}
 .southeast-industry-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.southeast-industry-links button{min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;background:#edf3f1;color:#264c52;border:1px solid #8a9e9c;font:inherit;font-size:12px}p{font-size:13px;line-height:2}h3{font-size:14px;margin:22px 0 8px}summary{min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a74830;outline-offset:2px}[hidden]{display:none!important}
</style>
